xt":"The race went on with Farina effortlessly opening up a gap to Biondetti.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":8,"text":"Emilio Villoresi passes Siena and Arzani for third.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":11,"text":"Villoresi made a fast stop to change a spark plug.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":13,"text":"Count Festetics retires with carburettor problems.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":14,"text":"Soffietti's Maserati is out with a broken differential.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":16,"text":"Siena has now caught Arzani and the duo started a fight for fourth position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":4},{"lap":21,"text":"Farina laps in 2m24.4s.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":24,"text":"On the 24th lap \"Ventidue\" overturned his Monza in a corner. Luckily the driver escaped without injuries.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":30,"text":"Siena is 0.8 seconds behind Arzani after 30 laps.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":32,"text":"Farina had let Biondetti close in a bit but around lap 32 he started to drive faster again.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":45,"text":"With five laps to go Farina slowed down the pace a bit","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":50,"text":"Farina wins, over 100 seconds ahead of Biondetti, with Villoresi another 39 seconds behind; the rest are flagged in.","q":false,"c":0}]}